{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂愛溢れるマネージャーさんのネイル第4弾\n番外編"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、番外編！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はネイルじゃなくて\n自作のスマホケース"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/19/5326372/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/19/5326372/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無地のケースに紫のポスカで\n普通に手書きで書いてあってすごいよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/19/5326372/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左上のはフィンランド語で\n「努力 感謝 笑顔」って書いてあるの！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/19/5326372/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのネイルを紹介させてもらった3人とも\nまた別のマネージャーさんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいなあ～＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"週刊プレイボーイ増刊\n『乃木坂４６×週刊プレイボーイ２０１５』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おととい発売されました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱちぱちぱち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうチェックされてる方が\nほとんどかもしれませんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎きいちゃん、蘭世、ひめたん、未央奈、中田の5人のグラビア\n「ＳＷＥＡＴ　＆　ＰＲＩＤＥ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂４６ウワサの真相スペシャル２０１５\n「まだだ、まだ終わらんよ！」福神からアンダー......からの大逆転を期す　逆襲の中田花奈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の2ヵ所に載ってます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆襲の中田花奈 の中にある左下の\n「中田花奈の歩み」を、読んでたら\n自分の人生を軽く振り返った形になって\n軽く涙が出そうになりました(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グラビアもいい感じに撮っていただきましたよ茶髪中田、初のグラビアになりますね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/19/5326372/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれね、\n『命は美しい』のサビを踊ってたんだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/19/5326372/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこを開いても開いても\n乃木坂46！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ファンの方々には\nかなーり\n見ごたえのある、読みごたえのある\n1冊になってると思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/19/5326372/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大事にしてね～\nよろしくお願いします＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}